made by and The ACPI virtual machine does not completely simulate
the behavior of a machine with an ACPI BIOS.  In the current  im‐
plementation,  the  ACPI virtual machine only reads or writes the
stored values by emulating access to regions such  as  SystemMem‐
ory.  Because the AML interpreter interprets and disassembles si‐
multaneously, it is impossible to implement such features as set‐
ting  breakpoints with the specified line number in ASL.  Setting
breakpoints at certain Control Methods, which is not very  diffi‐
cult, has not yet implemented because nobody has ever needed it.
